title: Authorizations › New case › Referral › Checklist buttons
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId?ref=RF-2053
intro: The buttons around the referral checklist: replace the documents, ask the referrer, decline, open the full page, and the main button, which changes with the referral's status.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: 'Demo: the referrer replies' stands in for the referrer answering.
---
start s1 "On the referral checklist"
screen sc1 "Referral checklist\nPatient card, four sections, buttons below"

group gTop "Above the card"
  click cDiff "Click 'Use different documents'"
  process pDiff "Address becomes ?ref= (empty), so the start screen shows\nThe case keeps its old referral until you continue"
endgroup
goto gStart "Continues in: New case › Referral › Start screen"

group gFoot "Under the sections"
  decision dAsk "Open, not waiting, and something to ask?\n(age is never counted)"
  click cFoot "Click 'Ask the referrer for the missing item'\nor '…for the 4 missing items'"
  click cDec "Click 'Decline'\n(only while open)"
  decision dWait "Awaiting info?"
  click cDemo "Click 'Demo: the referrer replies'"
  click cFull "Click 'Open the full referral'"
endgroup
goto gAsk "Continues in: New case › Referral › Ask the referrer"
goto gOk "Continues in: New case › Referral › Mark OK or decline"
goto gFull "Continues in: New case › Referral › The full referral page"

decision dSt "Referral status?"
click cAcc "Click 'Accept referral and continue'\nNever disabled while the referral is open"
process pAcc "Open items are only listed in the Accept dialog\nYou can accept anyway"
goto gAcc "Continues in: New case › Referral › Accept a referral"
toast tAcc "Green banner\n'Accepted into IOP. Target admission 10/21/2026.'"
click cCont "Click 'Continue to medical records'"
process pCont "Referral goes into the case\nPatient, payer, level of care, diagnoses, reason\nReferral becomes the first document"
toast tCont "'Referral RF-2054 is in this case'\n'V.C., 30. Next, add the medical records.'"
goto gMed "Continues in: New case › Medical records"
toast tDec "Red banner\n'Declined: Needs a higher level of care.'"
click cRe "Click 'Reopen referral'"
store stRe "Referral is In review again\nDecision cleared"
toast tRe "'Referral reopened'\n'RF-2048 is back In review.'"
endx eAdm "Admitted: the card has no main button"

s1 --> sc1
sc1 --> cDiff --> pDiff --> gStart

sc1 --> dAsk
dAsk -->|Yes| cFoot --> gAsk
dAsk -->|No| cDec
sc1 --> cDec --> gOk
sc1 --> dWait
dWait -->|Yes| cDemo --> gAsk
dWait -->|No| cFull
sc1 --> cFull --> gFull

sc1 --> dSt
dSt -->|New, In review, Awaiting info| cAcc --> pAcc --> gAcc
dSt -->|Accepted or Scheduled| tAcc --> cCont --> pCont --> tCont --> gMed
dSt -->|Declined| tDec --> cRe --> stRe --> tRe
dSt -->|Admitted| eAdm
